# Transit director districts cross city and county lines, so they are their own root.
ballot @transit "Franklin Regional Transit Board of Directors"
  eligibility "Transit districts cross city and county lines. Your sample ballot shows which district, if any, you vote in."
  note:
    The transit district does not fit inside any one city, so it is its own ballot here rather
    than a sub-ballot of one of them.

